# No deploy without explicit ask (LOCKED)

**User order:** Deploy **sirf** jab user clearly bole. Agent **khud se** Hostinger / FTP / `deploy:*` / live push **kabhi nahi**.

## Gate

- Code fix / build / test ke baad deploy **auto mat chalao**.
- “Done”, “fix”, “smoke”, “verify”, “Ho gaya” ≠ deploy permission.
- Deploy **sirf** jab user explicitly kahe: `deploy`, `deploy karo`, `push live`, `deploy:fast`, `deploy:api`, target name (`flowers` / `central` / `all`), ya clear “Hostinger pe bhejo”.

## Banned without ask

- `npm run deploy:*` / `node scripts/deploy-*.js`
- Full or delta FTP / Hostinger upload
- “just in case” live push after a fix

## Allowed without ask

- Local edit, `npm run build`, typecheck, unit/smoke against **already live** URLs (read-only curl/probe)
- Explain which deploy command **would** be used — do not run it until asked

## When user asks deploy

Follow `ultra-fast-delta-deploy.mdc` (delta only; full only if they say full).
